// @expect-error Call to 'risky' can throw 'Failure'. A 'catch' clause does not catch what the code inside it throws, and this method cannot be marked 'throws', because one of the methods it overrides or implements does not throw 'Failure'. Move the call into a function that catches 'Failure' with a 'catch' clause.
